            "link": ""
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "html": "<p>A to Z Consultants, a part of the global <a href=\"https://alifgroups.com/\">Alif Group</a>, provides a comprehensive range of financial consulting and business advisory services. Whether you are a privately owned business, a growing enterprise, or an organization seeking specialist advice, we offer a complete service backed by a proven track record.</p><p>Our services are strategically designed to support businesses throughout their entire lifecycle—from initial start-up and market entry to growth, transformation, succession, and managed exit.</p><p>As part of the Alif Group, our capabilities extend far beyond traditional consulting. We leverage the Group’s extensive geographical footprint across the UAE, Saudi Arabia, Malaysia, Indonesia, the United Kingdom and Canada to facilitate seamless cross-border expansions. Furthermore, our close integration with our sister concerns allows us to provide clients with a true single-window solution. Through this network, we deliver streamlined access to world-class services including international tax planning, regulatory compliance, and cutting-edge corporate technology solutions on a global scale.</p>"
        },
